     **[0m[2mBug 1 —[0m[2m Duplicate processing** (`[0m[2mjob_queue.py:[0m[2m23[0m[2m-28[0m[2m`): `[0m[2mdequeue()` checked[0m[2m `job["status[0m[2m"] == "pending[0m[2m"[0m[2m`, then yielded[0m[2m via[0m[2m `await asyncio.sleep[0m[2m(0.01[0m[2m)` *[0m[2mbefore* setting[0m[2m status[0m[2m to `"processing"[0m[2m`. This[0m[2m allowed all[0m[2m 5 workers[0m[2m to see[0m[2m the same job as[0m[2m "pending" and[0m[2m claim it. **[0m[2mFix**:[0m[2m move[0m[2m `[0m[2mjob["status"][0m[2m = "processing"`[0m[2m before the `await[0m[2m`, making[0m[2m the claim[0m[2m atomic with[0m[2m respect to the event[0m[2m loop.
     
